{%- comment -%}
  Designer/label detection, two signals, title match first:

  1. Product title keyword match — works whenever the designer name is
     literally in the title.
  2. Real Shopify collection membership — used only when (1) finds nothing.
     These are the actual designer collections from the live "Debut" theme's
     own main-menu ("Designers" submenu, confirmed via the menus() API), the
     same collections the merchant already curates by hand. Title-matching
     alone significantly undercounts real designers because most products
     don't repeat the designer name in every title — e.g. Adee/Little A:
     title match finds ~8 products, the real `adee` collection has 59.
     Comparing title-match counts against these real collection counts is
     what surfaced the gap; collection membership is the more complete
     signal, so it's used as the fallback rather than replacing title
     matching (title still wins when both would apply, since it's more
     specific about which of two combined designers a product actually is).

  "Little Bo Peep" and the old Babyfer/Ela Confection/Anafie-smock group have
  NO working signal anywhere on Shopify — their own native collections
  (`little-bo-peeps`, `babyfer`) are deleted, confirmed by direct query, so
  even the live site's own nav links for these are currently broken. Nothing
  here can fix that without the merchant re-tagging products or recreating
  those collections. Until then this returns blank for both rather than
  guessing.
  Usage: {% capture brand %}{% render 'brand-of', product: product %}{% endcapture %}
{%- endcomment -%}
{%- assign found = '' -%}
{%- if product.tags contains 'Little Bo Peep' -%}{%- assign found = 'Little Bo Peep' -%}
{%- elsif product.title contains 'Ceaser Blanco' -%}{%- assign found = 'Ceaser Blanco' -%}
{%- elsif product.title contains 'Ela Confection' -%}{%- assign found = 'Ela Confection' -%}
{%- elsif product.title contains 'Lapin House' -%}{%- assign found = 'Lapin House' -%}
{%- elsif product.title contains 'Balloon Chic' -%}{%- assign found = 'Balloon Chic' -%}
{%- elsif product.title contains 'Abuela Tata' -%}{%- assign found = 'Abuela Tata' -%}
{%- elsif product.title contains 'Mitch & Son' -%}{%- assign found = 'Mitch & Son' -%}
{%- elsif product.title contains 'Little A' -%}{%- assign found = 'Little A' -%}
{%- elsif product.title contains 'Deolinda' -%}{%- assign found = 'Deolinda' -%}
{%- elsif product.title contains 'Babyfer' -%}{%- assign found = 'Babyfer' -%}
{%- elsif product.title contains 'Monnalisa' -%}{%- assign found = 'Monnalisa' -%}
{%- elsif product.title contains 'Sonata' -%}{%- assign found = 'Sonata' -%}
{%- elsif product.title contains 'Rahigo' -%}{%- assign found = 'Rahigo' -%}
{%- elsif product.title contains 'Miranda' -%}{%- assign found = 'Miranda' -%}
{%- elsif product.title contains 'Naxos' -%}{%- assign found = 'Naxos' -%}
{%- elsif product.title contains 'Adee' -%}{%- assign found = 'Adee' -%}
{%- elsif product.title contains 'Daga' -%}{%- assign found = 'Daga' -%}
{%- elsif product.title contains "Levi's" -%}{%- assign found = "Levi's" -%}
{%- elsif product.title contains 'Gant' -%}{%- assign found = 'Gant' -%}
{%- elsif product.title contains 'Giorgio' -%}{%- assign found = 'Giorgio Bambini' -%}
{%- endif -%}
{%- if found == '' -%}
  {%- for c in product.collections -%}
    {%- case c.handle -%}
      {%- when 'miranda-a-w19' -%}{%- assign found = 'Miranda' -%}
      {%- when 'adee' -%}{%- assign found = 'Adee & Little A' -%}
      {%- when 'lolattes-aw20' -%}{%- assign found = 'Daga & Lapin House' -%}
      {%- when 'balloon-chic-aw21' -%}{%- assign found = 'Balloon Chic & Abuela Tata' -%}
      {%- when 'rahigo-aw21' -%}{%- assign found = 'Rahigo' -%}
      {%- when 'mitch-and-son' -%}{%- assign found = "Mitch & Son & Levi's" -%}
      {%- when 'ceaser-blanco' -%}{%- assign found = 'Ceaser Blanco & Naxos' -%}
      {%- when 'monnalisa' -%}{%- assign found = 'Monnalisa' -%}
      {%- when 'got-2' -%}{%- assign found = 'Giorgio Bambini' -%}
      {%- when 'gant' -%}{%- assign found = 'Gant' -%}
    {%- endcase -%}
    {%- if found != '' -%}{%- break -%}{%- endif -%}
  {%- endfor -%}
{%- endif -%}
{{- found -}}
